    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure across space and time! Portal into diverse worlds to hunt monsters, battle bosses, loot treasures, complete objectives. Collect an arsenal of weapons, magic, equipment and player classes to overcome obstacles and progress in your journey across your Cosmic Dream.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in dynamic melee and ranged combat with various weapons, magic, equipment, and consumables. Create unique builds that suit your playstyle. Dodge attacks, block damage, or parry to topple enemies for free attacks. Beware of diverse enemy types that will challenge you at every turn. Fight solo, hire AI mercenaries or summon monsters to assist you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of different type of vehicles are available for navigating the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft consumables, equipment, and magic by collecting items across the world and utilizing your base services. Mine ore to create ingots for essential armor upgrades. Some items, magic, and equipment can only be obtained by defeating bosses, while others are exclusive to crafting or purchasing from specified vendors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new classes by interacting with the world and overcoming challenges. Each class is unique with it's own set of equipment, weapons and powers. You can mix and match power and equipment from different classes to create your own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and mysterious story spanning dimensions of time and space where two souls urge to be together again.  No matter what....Get to Neon City!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite online friends to join your world and help you overcome challenges.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic adventure across space and time! Portal into diverse worlds to hunt monsters, battle bosses, loot treasures, complete objectives. Collect an arsenal of weapons, magic, equipment and player classes to overcome obstacles and progress in your journey across your Cosmic Dream.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in dynamic melee and ranged combat with various weapons, magic, equipment, and consumables. Create unique builds that suit your playstyle. Dodge attacks, block damage, or parry to topple enemies for free attacks. Beware of diverse enemy types that will challenge you at every turn. Fight solo, hire AI mercenaries or summon monsters to assist you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A series of different type of vehicles are available for navigating the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft consumables, equipment, and magic by collecting items across the world and utilizing your base services. Mine ore to create ingots for essential armor upgrades. Some items, magic, and equipment can only be obtained by defeating bosses, while others are exclusive to crafting or purchasing from specified vendors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Class System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new classes by interacting with the world and overcoming challenges. Each class is unique with it's own set of equipment, weapons and powers. You can mix and match power and equipment from different classes to create your own playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique and mysterious story spanning dimensions of time and space where two souls urge to be together again.  No matter what....Get to Neon City!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite online friends to join your world and help you overcome challenges.</p>",
